obs This lap died before its commit and was recovered from the round-open stash at 20260907.092723, and by then a peer had spent both %551 and %552. The row renumbered 551 -> 553 on the fetch: its stamp 20260907.091632 is the key and held, the number is a view and moved. Corrected in this record so its links open the file that exists.
recommend keep-going -- the lane's next real work is the weave's several-line interleave, which wants an anchor per insert and therefore Keaton's word; until then the copy_sameness guard whose corpus emptied is a clean agent-doable lap.
